    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_05",
      "hash64": "C47810FDD2B29C62",
      "text": "♪Vienes a retarme, a medirte en combate.\\nCon rimas espectrales yo te digo: ¡adelante!♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_06",
      "hash64": "C4780FFDD2B29AAF",
      "text": "♪Ponle empeño, es el momento, luce tu talento.\\nEres un joven portento, ¡no tengas miramientos!♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_07",
      "hash64": "C4780EFDD2B298FC",
      "text": "¡Ven, chaval[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a, y dale a mi alma un meneo bueno![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_08",
      "hash64": "C47815FDD2B2A4E1",
      "text": "¡Ja, ja, ja! ¡Flipo contigo! ¡Menuda tunda me has\\ndado![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_09",
      "hash64": "C47814FDD2B2A32E",
      "text": "¡Me has dejado el alma que parece un batido![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_10",
      "hash64": "C47487FDD2AF7DC0",
      "text": "Perdona por lo de novat[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, por cierto.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
